## Model card

- **Name:** GLM 5.3 FlashX
- **Short description:** Z.ai's high-speed variant of GLM-5.3-Flash on the same hybrid sparse + linear attention architecture, tuned for efficient coding, visual understanding, and long-horizon agents at up to 200 tokens/s.
- **Provider / access:** OpenRouter `z-ai/glm-5.3-flashx` (single Z.ai-hosted provider); OpenAI-compatible API. Function calling supported (agentic positioning); JSON-mode enforcement undisclosed.
- **Release / knowledge:** 2026-09-18 release (OpenRouter, verified); knowledge cutoff unknown.
- **IDs:** `z-ai/glm-5.3-flashx` (OpenRouter); `opencode/glm-5.3-flashx` (Zen).
- **Context window:** 1,000,000 (OpenRouter, verified); max output undisclosed.
- **Modalities:** native multimodal per vendor (coding + visual understanding + long-horizon agents); exact input/output list undisclosed on spec page — text verified, image/video unconfirmed.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-10-06):** $0.37/$1.25 per 1M in/out, cache read $0.09 (OpenRouter, verified).
- **Architecture:** hybrid sparse + linear attention, 320B total / 18B active (OpenRouter vendor description, verified); proprietary.

